Syntax
set-condition monitor <MONITOR-NAME> {{lt | le | eq | ne | gt | ge} <VALUE>[for {seconds | minutes | hours | days} <DURATION>] | transition from <STRING-LIST> to <STRING-LIST>}
no set-condition monitor <MONITOR-NAME> {{lt | le | eq | ne | gt | ge} <VALUE> [for {seconds | minutes | hours | days} <DURATION>] | transition from <STRING-LIST> to <STRING-LIST>}
clear-condition monitor <MONITOR-NAME> {{lt | le | eq | ne | gt | ge} <VALUE> [for {seconds | minutes | hours | days} <DURATION>] | transition from <STRING-LIST> to <STRING-LIST>}
no clear-condition monitor <MONITOR-NAME> {{lt | le | eq | ne | gt | ge} <VALUE> [for {seconds | minutes | hours | days} <DURATION>] | transition from <STRING-LIST> to <STRING-LIST>}

Description
Defines the condition for the monitor resource events. Once the condition is met, one or more actions are executed based on the configuration.
